{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:37 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:37 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:37 2026-10-26 HKT</p><p>元朗發生狗咬人事件。今日（26日）早上8時，一名男子報稱在元朗壆圍西路一貨倉內， 遭3隻唐狗追趕，並被其中一隻狗咬傷左小腿。救援人員接報到場，將事主送往博愛醫院治理。</p><p>據了解，咬人狗隻是由貨倉飼養，日常活動範圍亦在貨倉內，而被咬男子則為貨倉員工，他的傷勢輕微。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"事發於元朗壆圍西路一貨倉。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a1cdc924eabeb46e572e7f4d187a904d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_45.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"場內養有多隻狗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0c7d878e2cebfefa7bf417f1efe2de12/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5672a9dc0a3b9e3ad769913997b35da0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_43_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"日常狗隻的活動範圍在貨倉內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e8812f32676aa86015c6158f8cc6f8db/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_43.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5e9396015d88af716cb407680636d5a1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_42_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c5f8edc51f7dabe6e6ae00213d91e154/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9195810ee0a524ed42d16e633982d185/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_41_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e8f0eeb995fa35f31f7fc85b5ddf9829/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_41.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c3a7cae3a5bb875b6f653c1afad6585c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_40_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/930ea13207356c46447f1cecb6b04f95/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場放有用作餵狗的器皿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/38bc8c8745da564d663654883742671f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_44_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1342999144baf0c098a7b6b5373e87a5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_40.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b11cc3c7de296c6f955375d195f053e3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_39_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2f1f4d55202ebc1da65d7d5f2717c721/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e176d1f1c973dedf696d96db1795661d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_11_03_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"被狗咬傷男子由救護車送往博愛醫院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/48f06320c0104749190ba6892442e1d1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_10_40_25.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"被狗咬傷男子由救護車送往博愛醫院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/71f0072779fad9d653657ab0331ff25b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_10_40_24.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/25b855163e123fceb609e6dfdd02d409/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_10_40_25_1_.jpeg\"/><p><br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:38.127715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:37:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:31.006105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:43.314150+00:00","content_hash":"23eb263d682a651976e7c57007f9a6939ee12735351e40fb79e9e637aa62ae6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}